<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.14 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK NOV DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.14 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 5.14 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Nov 20			4,300</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Nov		6,362</p>
<p> Average reserves to Nov 17			   7,443</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,137</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
